<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!--
  Ltse Equities Memoir Top Of Book Sbe v2.0, transcribed from the pdf. LTSE published no SBE xml schema
  for v2.0, so this file was written by hand from "MEMOIR Top of Book Feed for LTSE-v2.0.pdf" (MEMOIR
  Top of Book Feed v2.0, OmiDocuments Ltse/MEMOIR), checked against the LTSE "Specification Errata"
  (June 2026, section 3.3), starting from LTSE's published v1.3 schema (memoir-top.xml). It is not an
  LTSE file.

  From the pdf: SchemaId 3, header unchanged (6 bytes); version 512 (0x0200) from the v2.0 hex dumps.
  Instrument Directory drops MPV; Security Trading Status adds HaltReason; Best Bid Offer, Best Bid and
  Best Bid Short add BidFlags; Best Bid Offer, Best Offer and Best Offer Short add OfferFlags; Auction
  Trade (16), Broken Auction Trade (17) and Corrected Auction Trade (18) are new. The pdf prints no
  BlockLength for this feed: each is the sum of the field lengths in its table. The Best Bid Offer, Best
  Bid, Best Offer and Best Bid/Offer Short hex dumps in the pdf are the v1 layouts without the flags.
  Enum value names follow the pdf, and the names its v2.0 encoder examples use (RegularTrade,
  AuctionTrade). The errata says AuctionQuantity is INT64; the v2.0 pdf message table prints UINT64,
  which this file follows.
  Not printed in the pdf, carried from v1.3: package and field ids.
-->
<sbe:messageSchema xmlns:sbe="http://fixprotocol.io/2016/sbe" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" byteOrder="bigEndian" id="3" package="com.memx.us_equities.memoir.top.sbe.v2" semanticVersion="2.0" version="512" xsi:schemaLocation="http://fixprotocol.io/2016/sbe">
